STILL RECORDING, tape 12: "Lost Child" (2026). Halloway Archive. Original story, pictures, sound and music. A work of fiction.

Pictures: drawn in code (canvas 2D) with the tape kit (channel/brand/tapekit.js): a 2.5D renderer, CCTV grading, the handheld camcorder look and VHS damage. The center court, the information desk and the child mannequin (built in 3D from tapered bodies swept along curved spines, jointed at the neck, shoulders and elbows, as in tape 11) are drawn for this tape (film.js).
Fonts: VT323 (The VT323 Project Authors), SIL Open Font License 1.1. Special Elite (Astigmatic), Apache License 2.0.
Voice: ElevenLabs text-to-speech, model eleven_v4. The mall's PA: "HA Mall PA"; Leon Marsh: "HA Leon Marsh" (ElevenLabs Voice Design, made for this series).
Sound effects: generated with ElevenLabs Sound Effects (prompts in sfx/prompts.json).
Music: none. A low drone made from the mall's own ventilation (tools/score.py).
Sound: every sound is in the center court and is heard through Leon's camcorder or CAM 08, the PA through the mall's ceiling speakers (tools/mix.py).
